<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arvind Mills rated sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arvind Mills rated sell.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said Friday analyst Ajay Jindal had started coverage of Indian textile producer Arvind Mills Ltd with a rating of sell.</p>
<p>&quot;Falling other income and rising interest rates will blunt the effect of expected EBITDA growth for Arvind Mills,&quot; Jindal wrote in a May 7 report.</p>
<p>--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
